{"real": false, "dur": 15.9, "sent": [{"start": 0.4, "end": 4.63, "text": "As the name suggests, the whole thing is organised around goals.", "words": [{"w": "As", "s": 0.4}, {"w": "the", "s": 0.78}, {"w": "name", "s": 1.17}, {"w": "suggests,", "s": 1.55}, {"w": "the", "s": 1.94}, {"w": "whole", "s": 2.32}, {"w": "thing", "s": 2.71}, {"w": "is", "s": 3.09}, {"w": "organised", "s": 3.48}, {"w": "around", "s": 3.86}, {"w": "goals.", "s": 4.25}]}, {"start": 4.98, "end": 9.98, "text": "I call them goals, but they’re really what teachers know as learning objectives.", "words": [{"w": "I", "s": 4.98}, {"w": "call", "s": 5.37}, {"w": "them", "s": 5.75}, {"w": "goals,", "s": 6.13}, {"w": "but", "s": 6.52}, {"w": "they’re", "s": 6.9}, {"w": "really", "s": 7.29}, {"w": "what", "s": 7.67}, {"w": "teachers", "s": 8.06}, {"w": "know", "s": 8.44}, {"w": "as", "s": 8.83}, {"w": "learning", "s": 9.21}, {"w": "objectives.", "s": 9.6}]}, {"start": 10.33, "end": 14.95, "text": "And the communicative goals are much like what ACTFL calls can-do statements.", "words": [{"w": "And", "s": 10.33}, {"w": "the", "s": 10.72}, {"w": "communicative", "s": 11.1}, {"w": "goals", "s": 11.48}, {"w": "are", "s": 11.87}, {"w": "much", "s": 12.25}, {"w": "like", "s": 12.64}, {"w": "what", "s": 13.02}, {"w": "ACTFL", "s": 13.41}, {"w": "calls", "s": 13.79}, {"w": "can-do", "s": 14.18}, {"w": "statements.", "s": 14.56}]}]}